RE:
Application for bar and grill(entertainment)liquor license for Wyoming Horse Racing
LLC(Horse Palace,1802Dell Range, Suite3, Cheyenne, WY82009)
Dear Mayor Collins and Members of the Cheyenne City Council:
Our firm represents Wyoming Horse Racing LLC ("WHR") and respectfully submits the enclosed
application for abar and grill(entertainment)liquor license forWHR's current location of 1802 Dell
Range, Suite3, Cheyenne, WY82009.
WHR provides pari-mutuel wagering through historic horseracing terminals, as well as live and simulcast
horse racing events at locationsin the city of Cheyenne and throughout the state of Wyoming.WHR is a
thriving companyin good standing with the Wyoming Secretary of State, all creditors, the Wyoming
Gaming Commission, and all cities, towns and counties in which it currently operates.WHR employs
many Wyoming residents(bothin this community and beyond) and continues to help communities thrive
by creating jobs and economic stability for small business owners in each municipality within which it
operates.
Forits application, WHR encloses the following documentation:
1.New or Transfer Liquor License or Permit Application
2.Limited Liability Company Annual Report (per requirement of financial statement)
3.Lease agreement with amendments and extensions
4.Floor plan
5.Evidence of WHR's pending application with the Cheyenne Laramie County Public Health for a
Wyoming Department of Agriculture Food License (NOTE: WHR will in the near future
separately apply for a license tooperate as arestaurant(food service establishment)pursuant to
Cheyenne Ordinance #3157, City Code,5.08.090 and Chapter 8.40)
6.Proposed menu
7.Affidavit/Authorization of Peter Liguori, WHR Executive Vice President
8.Certificate of Good Standing from the Wyoming Secretary of State's Office
9.Letter verifying all employees attend an alcohol training program(TIPS)
10.Check for the required fees in the amount of $10,600.00($10,500.00 application fee and $100.00
publication fee)
WHR appreciates your consideration of this application for a bar and grill (entertainment)liquor license.
Ifyou need anything further or have any questions, donot hesitate to contact me directly.
Yours truly,
CROWLEY FLECK PL LP
Timothy L.Woznick
