Dear Eugene:
This note follows up our conversation concerning your desire to extend W'yoming Ilorse
Racing's lease for an additional 2 years. with a 2-year Option.
The original Leasc datcd 10/1/14was for an 18-month period through 4/30/16with an Option to
Extend for an additional 3 years.‘The Option called for annual 3% rent adjustments for cach of
the3 years. but these increases were never implcmented.
As the monthly Base Rent has not been adjusted for over 5 years. we came up with the following
analysis in determining our basis for this proposal.Had we increased the S4700 Base Rent 3 in
eachofihe past5years(including the3-year Option period）. themonthly Base Rent would no
be about S5450/month.
Our proposal is to request an adjustment in the monthly Base Rent to S5100/month.which would
remain fixed for the initial 2-year lease term 8/1/21-7/31/23.The $360 CAM charge would
remain the same.resulting in a combined monthly payment of $5+60/month (S5100 Base Rent
S360 CAM). There would be a S200 adjustmcnt to the Basc Rent (to S5300/month) upon
com mc n cement ofthe Option period.The total rent for the2-ycar Option period would thcn he
S5660/month (S5300 Base Rent+$360 CAM).which would also renain fixed for the cntire
Option period8/1/23-7/31/25.
Please note that the Basic Rental Rate is inclusive of Real Estate Taxes and Property Insurance.
but not basic Common Area Maintenance cxpenses (for gardening/snow removal/sweeping and
parking lot maintenance). water/sewer services.cxlerior lighting and rubbish removal.Ihesc
CAM charges may be adjusted at a later date.
